# NOTE: functions/.env.<project-id> files (e.g. functions/.env.mirit-nails)
# are deliberately NOT ignored — they hold deploy-time configuration only
# (e.g. INVOICE4U_ENVIRONMENT, RECEIPT_ISSUANCE_ENABLED), never secrets,
# and are meant to be tracked like firebase.json. A broader
# "functions/.env.*" pattern here previously (wrongly) excluded them too.
